      "file": "src/Phare/Console/Scheduling/ScheduleRunCommand.php",
      "root_cause": "Line 43: `count(array_filter($results, fn ($r) => $result['success']))` captures outer loop variable `$result` (from the foreach on line 28) instead of the lambda parameter `$r`. After the loop ends, `$result` holds the last iteration's value, so all events are counted as success or failure based solely on the last event.",
